      <p>We built this site for human beings who want to understand their nutrition. We want you to use the calculators daily, bookmark your favorite articles, and share the site with your friends. However, we have to protect our infrastructure from abuse.</p>
      <p><strong>Personal and Professional Use:</strong><br>
      If you are a personal user trying to lose weight, gain muscle, or maintain your physique, you are fully welcome here. If you are a personal trainer, a nutrition coach, or a gym owner, you are also welcome to use our tools with your clients! We love that. However, you may not pass off our site's automated calculations as your own bespoke medical advice. You must inform your clients that these are estimates.</p>
      <p><strong>Prohibited Actions (The"Don't Be a Jerk" Clause):</strong><br>
      Please do not use automated scripts, bots, spiders, or scrapers to extract data from our calculators or our <a href="/foods/">Food Database</a>. Our servers cost real money to run, and hitting our infrastructure with automated scraping tools slows down the site for regular users. If you are a developer looking for nutritional APIs, there are dedicated services out there for you. Any attempt to reverse-engineer our proprietary algorithms, DDoS our servers, inject malicious code, or steal our database will result in immediate IP bans and potential legal action.</p>
