      <p>What does this mean in plain English? It means that if you use our calculator, decide to go on a severe calorie deficit without consulting a doctor, and subsequently feel faint or suffer an injury at the gym, you cannot sue us. We provide these tools strictly"AS IS" and"AS AVAILABLE." We make no warranties that the site will be error-free, that the calculators won't occasionally have a bug, or that using our site will guarantee you lose exactly 2 pounds a week. Human biology is incredibly complex, and we are simply providing mathematical tools to help you navigate it. Your health outcomes are ultimately in your own hands.</p>
